  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/09/IMG_1464.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>A mediod&iacute;a de este jueves se ha inaugurado en el Palau de la Festa de Castell&oacute; la Feria Internacional MARTE, con las tendencias art&iacute;sticas m&aacute;s actuales, organizada por el ondense historiador del arte Joan Feliu Franch, junto a Enrique Boc&aacute;ngelus.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugmartecastello/img_1460.jpg\" alt=\"img_1460\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugmartecastello/img_1461.jpg\" alt=\"img_1461\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugmartecastello/img_1462.jpg\" alt=\"img_1462\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugmartecastello/img_1463.jpg\" alt=\"img_1463\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugmartecastello/img_1464.jpg\" alt=\"img_1464\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugmartecastello/img_1465.jpg\" alt=\"img_1465\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugmartecastello/img_1467.jpg\" alt=\"img_1467\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugmartecastello/img_1469.jpg\" alt=\"img_1469\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugmartecastello/img_1470.jpg\" alt=\"img_1470\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugmartecaste